Subject: [PATCH] feat(browser): safe remote PDF handling

- Remote https PDF URLs download into a private app directory (content
  type + %PDF magic verified, 256MB cap), then open read-only via the
  app FileProvider; direct external intents are never built from URLs
- Deterministic, sanitized file names derived from the URL digest
- Browser menu action reopens the current page's PDF
